  "policy_quote": "`create_shipment` needs the sender address (the account's `pickup_address`), the recipient address, the weight in kilograms and the service. Weight must be given in kilograms. If the customer gives pounds, convert (1 lb = 0.4536 kg) and round to one decimal.",
  "evidence_quote": "`weight_kg\": 11,`",
  "analysis": "The user provided the weight in pounds (11 lbs), which was correctly converted to kilograms (5.0 kg) in the assistant's confirmation message (`11 фунтов ≈ 5.0 кг`). However, the `create_shipment` tool call incorrectly used `weight_kg\": 11,` instead of the converted value (5.0 kg). This violates the policy requiring weight to be in kilograms and properly converted.",
  "verdict": "SUPPORTED"
}
